\0
Imperium researchers on Corlbad developed a weapon called the Dessicator. This chemical catalyst consumed water molecules and could decimate all life on an entire planet in a matter of minutes. As the weapon was nearing completion, the Imperium made plans to move it from the research facility where it was developed to Corlbad's capitol, where it could be transported off of the planet. The Freedom Guard learned of the weapon and the Imperium's plans to move it, and then attacked the research complex in an attempt to intercept the device before the Imperium could get it off Corlbad.
\1
With the Dessicator we will bring the Freedom Guard to its knees. A large attack force has set upon the research facility and it appears that we will not be able to hold out. We cannot allow the device to fall into the hands of the Freedom Guard. Evacuate the Dessicator to the rendezvous point where Colonel Martel will take the device and supply you with reinforcements. Once you've safely evacuated the device, destroy all the Freedom Guard invaders.
\n\n
\cOBJECTIVES\n
\n
-->  Move the Dessicator to the rendezvous\n
\s\s\s\s point\n
-->  Rebuild a base and eliminate the Freedom \n
\s\s\s\sGuard presence
\2
I am pleased with your progress.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
Under siege by the Freedom Guard forces on Corlbad, the Imperium attempted to move the completed Dessicator off-planet. A ground transport carrying the reactor core was intercepted by the Freedom Guard assault force, and the device was destroyed. In the attack the Freedom Guard force leveled the research facility where the Dessicator was developed, and several key researchers were killed. It was years before the Imperium was able to duplicate the weapon.
\3
Your failure has been noted.


